      "parameters": {
        "messages": {
          "message": [
            {
              "content": "You are an expert SEO strategist specializing in keyword extraction and social media analysis.",
              "role": "system"
            },
            {
              "content": "=Objective: Your goal is to extract 10 the most relevant and high-impact keywords or short keyphrases (up to 3 words) based on the content and context of a public social media profile. These keywords will be used for future SEO-optimized content creation.\n\nInput: \nlink to a public social media profile: \n{{ $('Start').item.json.Facebook_url }}\nProcess:\n\n1. Scrape and analyze the entire visible profile including:\n\nbio/description,\n\nrecent posts (captions, hashtags, engagement patterns),\n\nvisual or textual content themes,\n\nany location/business tags,\n\ntone and style.\n\n2. Understand the target audience implicitly from the type of content and interactions.\n\n3. Identify topics, problems, benefits, and interests that appear frequently or are implied.\n\n📤 Output Requirements:\n\nReturn exactly 10 keywords or keyphrases, separated by commas.\n\nUse words relevant for SEO (topics people might search for), not hashtags or generic phrases.\n\nEach keyword/keyphrase should be up to 3 words long, concise and content-driven.\n\nFocus on high relevance and high intent based on what the target audience would likely engage with or search.\n\nOutput Format:\n\nkeyword1, keyword2\n\ndon't add any additional text or explanations in the output."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
