            {
              "content": "=Your task is to analyze keywords found for client and filter out not relevant.\nThis keywords are used for social media posts creation and must be highly relevant to client's business.\nHere is the list of keywords:\n{{ $json.keyword[0] }}\n\nHere is client's business description:\n{{ $('Message a model7').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}\n\nYou also must insert chosen keywords in the table in markdown format and return formated table with keywords inside in  markdown. You must return only filled table without the template:\n  \n## Keywords\n\n| Keywords #1 |  |\n| ---| --- |\n| Keywords #2 |  |\n| Keywords #3 |  |\n| Keywords #4 |  |\n| Keywords #5 |  |\n| Keywords #6 |  |\n| Keywords #7 |  |\n| Keywords #8 |  |\n| Keywords #9 |  |\n| Keywords #10 |  |\n\nOutput format must be a JSON object in such structure:\n\"Related_keywords\": \"keywords devided by coma\",\n\"Table_markdown\": \"Formated table with keywords only\" "
            }
          ]
        },
